{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1648.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"f92f03d85df3be00d1df1b086bb65329786c17a78a981aebda18417c5b30bba5","ja":"桃子の演技力","zh":"桃子的演技力","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1648.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"a80147bd27d69d6160facf449f11beb39fc34cfb60e1e4b51222e9868f42fa5a","ja":"今日の美奈子と桃子のお仕事は、PV撮影。\n早めに事務所に来たため、少しくつろいでいて……","zh":"今天美奈子和桃子的工作是拍摄PV。\n因为提早来到了事务所，便稍微放松地休息了一会儿……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1648.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"7109c0a6975a471b20e89f4510160df66ad28f5e91d8b2c30d8b5d7edf48abcd","ja":"あ、映画のCMだ！\n見て！　今、桃子ちゃん、おっきく映ったよ！","zh":"啊，是电影的广告！\n快看！刚才桃子占了好大的特写镜头哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1648.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"364e16b09e3b063fc91f6248f064872af43222a31c1ad0ac62669f969ce1eddd","ja":"ふーん。このシーンが使われてるんだ。\nやっぱり、印象的だからかな？","zh":"哼～用了这一幕啊。\n果然是因为让人印象深刻吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1648.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"b7a44cdcfe7770f620c9cbd14cadd8819e0aced4e397c46d698889ccb5755661","ja":"桃子ちゃんの演技が、すごいからだと思うな。","zh":"我觉得是因为桃子的演技很棒吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1648.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"077d7026e54874f0e34d461ea72b6045c4fc1f202784b154561781626d938ccb","ja":"表情や感情を抑えて、無機質さや無垢さを\n出すのって、すごく大変だったでしょ？","zh":"抑制住表情与感情，表现出无机质感与纯真感，\n其实非常辛苦吧？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1648.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"5e8098883d8950379c30e7fd8428a71c7cc20ced03536ace50508e16d585b1b4","ja":"そ、そんなことないよ。桃子にかかれば\n表情を抑えて演技するくらい、簡単なんだから。","zh":"才、才没有那回事呢。对桃子来说，\n要克制住表情来演戏，可是很简单的。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1648.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"8a050727100c1eade0438224988b19b9d29b4ff7b48adc75b8e1b3f3d764cfc6","ja":"へえ～！　さっすが桃子ちゃんだね！","zh":"欸～！真不愧是桃子呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1648.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"1798c80c806ff157ffdee9998dee7aacbfdbe0c4f1c818a02c6f67212a0c027c","ja":"あれだけ完璧に感情をコントロールできるんだから、\n何をしても桃子ちゃんの演技は崩せないだろうなぁ。","zh":"既然能那么完美地控制好情绪，\n不管怎么做，都打乱不了桃子的演技吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1648.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"a0298636e1459ac1a27c95cf661d906deb5036db444c83ad01b1a392ae69e3b8","ja":"当然でしょ。桃子はプロなんだから！\n何があっても、無表情でいるくらい余裕だよっ。","zh":"那是当然的吧。因为桃子可是专业人士！\n不管发生什么事，保持面无表情这种事还是很轻松的啦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1648.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"079e4c28313b74a2b3f10e50955aee7bb79d5f52fda250982f1b17a7ea756473","ja":"おお～……！　それじゃあ、私が一日かけて\n桃子ちゃんを笑わそうとしても？","zh":"喔喔～……！那就算我花上一整天\n想逗桃子笑也不行吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1648.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"7cbce1f5589b8fb6e9933c6bca1694f1c2cd8680ed85fd5d100e62d1973e5a04","ja":"もちろん、耐えきれるよ！\n実際にやってみたっていいけど？","zh":"当然撑得住啦！\n就算真去试一下也没问题哦？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1648.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"8dfa4e3159fbdf1f0a48a6e046068fa843f8e662dc1c58eba28f038a89b10b0d","ja":"本当に！？　じゃあ、お言葉に甘えて、\n桃子ちゃんの演技力に挑戦させてもらっちゃおうかな！","zh":"真的吗！？那我就恭敬不如从命，\n来挑战一下桃子的演技吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1648.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"bdac9e488a5fe824aa38caf9487af5d9ab45e6f84c70144d1dcf24b274c688fb","ja":"いいよ！　受けて立ってあげる！\nルールはどうするの？","zh":"好啊！我接受你的挑战！\n规则要怎么定？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1648.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"6c93effb60eb359fabadaf852215fd878814137bdeaf1e01c3bca9a2391d0e02","ja":"じゃあ、今日一日、私がしたことで声をあげて\n笑ったり、明らかに笑顔になったらアウト、でいい？","zh":"那么，只要今天这一整天，因为我做的事而笑出声\n或是明显露出笑容就算出局，这样行吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1648.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"2e2a83dcad35c9be31313a4989b2a779e0d8ea6cbba516f0e5e8b5cba2354615","ja":"うん。……ふふん♪　桃子の演技力の高さ、\nしっかり見せてあげるんだから！","zh":"嗯。……哼哼♪ 我会好好展现一下，\n桃子的演技水平有多高的！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
